{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up as a slime. You have no shape and no purpose.<br>The world around you is quiet, but not dead. There\u2019s still a trace of life inside everything. In these remnants, DNA still exists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can absorb that DNA. Each one changes you.<br>You can carry the agility of a rabbit, the strength of a goat, and the calm of a fish within your body.<br>Every new DNA gives you a different form and a different way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes you become a rabbit and bounce off the walls to reach higher ground.<br>Sometimes you turn into a goat and break through obstacles.<br>Sometimes you dive into the water and swim like a fish.<br>Each transformation lets you see the world in a new way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a puzzle platformer.<br>Every step is about finding the right form at the right time.<br>It\u2019s not about getting stronger. It\u2019s about adapting.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4121290?t=1761682128","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121290/22c374da3a92bf773a8d39a63fcd382fd07de97d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761682128","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121290/61bc897357a97f2685498229dca80c823948df80/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761682128","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121290/61bc897357a97f2685498229dca80c823948df80/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761682128","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15}